  "title": "Air-Fried Kale Chips",
  "description": "Kale leaves crisp up into chips really quickly in the air fryer. These chips are simply seasoned with salt, pepper, and paprika, plus cayenne for a little kick.",
  "authors": [
    "LauraF"
  ],
